---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Electric Water Gun Wholesale Guide 2026: Choosing the Right Blaster | TOYFACTORY"
  description="Complete B2B guide for wholesale electric water guns. Compare fire-breathing, gatling, AK47, and ice burst models. Factory-direct pricing from ISO-certified manufacturer."
  keywords="Water Gun Wholesale, Electric Water Gun Factory, Fire-Breathing Water Gun, Gatling Water Gun Wholesale, Summer Toy Importer Guide"
>
  <nav class="bg-dark/95 border-b border-white/5 py-6 sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-8 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-xl font-display font-extrabold tracking-tighter hover:text-gold transition">
        TOY<span class="text-gold">FACTORY</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog" class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 hover:text-white transition flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>&larr;</span> BACK TO BLOG
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <article class="py-24 md:py-32 px-8 bg-[#0A0A0F] min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="bg-gold/10 text-gold text-[8px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest border border-gold/20">Product Guide</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Aug 3, 2026</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-gray-600">· 5 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-8 uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[1.1] italic">
          Electric Water Gun <span class="text-gold">Wholesale Guide</span> 2026
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Fire-breathing water guns, Gatling blasters, and ice burst models are among the fastest-growing summer toy categories. Here's what wholesale buyers and importers need to evaluate before placing a bulk order.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-10">

        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-[1.9]">
          The electric water gun category has evolved far beyond simple squirt pistols. Today's models feature <strong class="text-white">LED lighting effects, fire-breathing mist nozzles, drum magazines, and Gatling-style rotating barrels</strong>. For wholesale buyers, this category offers strong margins: factory prices start at $3.42 per unit for entry-level electric blasters, with retail prices typically hitting $15–$35 in Western markets.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight pt-4">The 4 Water Gun Sub-Types Every Buyer Should Know</h2>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">1. Fire-Breathing Water Guns</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          These models combine a water spray mechanism with an LED-illuminated mist nozzle that creates a "fire" visual effect. The <a href="/product/TF210951" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF210951 Space Ring</a> (MOQ 180, $5.31/piece) and <a href="/product/TF210956" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF210956 Drum Version</a> (MOQ 144, $5.46/piece) are our two strongest performers in this sub-category, accounting for 134 YouTube views in under a week.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">2. Gatling-Style Water Guns</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          Rotating multi-barrel designs that appeal to the action toy market. The <a href="/product/TF211526" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF211526 Gatling</a> (350ml capacity, MOQ 150, $9.29/piece) and <a href="/product/TF211527" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF211527 Single-Tube Gatling</a> (MOQ 80, $14.50/piece) are ideal for mid-to-premium retail positioning.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">3. AK47 / Tactical Designs</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          The <a href="/product/TF211017" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF211017 AK47 Transparent Racing Light</a> (MOQ 60, $6.51/piece) features a transparent body with multicolor LED racing lights — this visual hook makes it a social media favorite and a strong impulse-buy product for e-commerce sellers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide pt-2">4. Ice Burst / Aurora Series</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          The <a href="/product/TF212706" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF212706 Ice Burst Aurora</a> (MOQ 144, $3.42/piece) and <a href="/product/TF212709" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition">TF212709 Ice Flame Double Gun</a> round out the budget-friendly tier with distinctive lighting effects.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight pt-4">Pricing Tiers at a Glance</h2>
        <div class="bg-[#15151A] border border-white/5 p-8 my-8">
          <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <div class="flex justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/5">
              <span class="text-gray-400">Entry-Level</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold">$3.42 – $5.46/piece</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/5">
              <span class="text-gray-400">Mid-Range</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold">$6.13 – $8.16/piece</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-400">Premium</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold">$9.29 – $14.50/piece</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight pt-4">What Certifications Matter for Water Guns</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-[1.9]">
          Electric water guns fall under the same toy safety regulations as all other toys. At minimum, your supplier should provide <strong class="text-white">CE, ASTM F963, and EN-71 certifications</strong>. Additionally, since water guns involve electronic components (LEDs, motors, batteries), <strong class="text-white">RoHS compliance</strong> is critical for EU market entry. TOYFACTORY ships all water guns with the full certification package.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gold/5 border border-gold/20 p-10 mt-16 text-center">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4 uppercase">Source Water Guns at Factory Pricing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">Request our complete water gun catalog with 12 models, tiered pricing, and logistics specs.</p>
          <a href="/#rfq" class="inline-block bg-gold text-dark px-12 py-5 font-bold uppercase text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] hover:bg-white transition-all">
            Request Water Gun Catalog &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <footer class="py-24 border-t border-white/5 bg-[#050508] text-center">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
      <div class="flex gap-10 text-[9px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-bold">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-gold transition">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-gold transition">Terms</a>
        <a href="/return" class="hover:text-gold transition">Returns</a>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[9px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-bold italic">
        &copy; 2026 TOYFACTORY Manufacturing. Global B2B Standards.
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
